    -- legacy 01a16b6f-1d46-7872-bb29-458dd6ccc7f9 (open): Record every closure the network checker boots, with the devices of its own arm
    -- `scripts/check/check-sel4-io-network-plane.py` boots 15 closures. Only `sel4-io-network` has a
    -- record in `contracts/system-test-run/v1/runs/`. Thirteen others have none. The fifteenth, `sel4-io-
    -- tcp-buffers`, has no closure yet and is planned. `check_records_and_planes_correspond` compares the
    -- declared runs with the record files. A closure that no table declares is therefore invisible to it.
    -- A run without a record has no frozen timeout, device list or failure markers. `extract()` also reads
    -- the whole checker file for devices. It gave the `sel4-io-network` record a `virtio-net-device`,
    -- although that arm attaches no device.
    (h.planned "01a1b49c-ace6-71a3-9f97-11f90fd38c48"
